            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-08-18T14:21:11+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 08/18/2026 - 14:21\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-10-09T12:01:54+00:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EFri, 10/09/2026 - 12:01\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "body": "\u003Cp\u003ERerai Umntwana iApp yekurera vana yakagadzirirwa vabereki, vachengeti vevana, nevashandi vanopa mabasa ekutsigira vana nemhuri muZimbabwe. Iapp ye Bazi reHutano ne Kuchengetwa zvakanaka Kwevana (Ministry of Health and Child Care), ichitsigirwa ne UNICEF Zimbabwe uye ichipihwa mari ne Hurumende yeJapan.UNICEF inoshanda munyika nenzvimbo dzinopfuura zana nemakumi mashanu kubatsira vana kurarama uye kubudirira kubva paudiki kusvika pakuyaruka.\u003Cbr\u003E&nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERuzivo rwe application&nbsp;\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERerai Umntwana yakagadzirwa kuti igadzirise zvingadiwa nezvido zvakasiyana zvevabereki nevachengeti vevana muZimbabwe. Vabereki vakawanda vanosangana nedambudziko rekushaya mukana wakakwana wekuwana ruzivo rwakavimbika uye rwakavakirwa pauchapupu pamusoro peutano hwevana, kudya kunovaka muviri uye kukura nekurerwa kwevana.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EApp iyi ine chinangwa che kuvhara gwanza iri nekupa vabereki nevachengeti vevana vadiki mazano anoshanda, anoenderana netsika nemararamiro emuZimbabwe, pamusoro pekudya kunovaka muviri, utano, kukura nekurerwa kwevana uye nzira dzakanaka dzekurera vana.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERerai Umntwana chishandiso chinotsigira kurera kwakanaka uye kuteerera. Chinangwa chayo ndechekupa ruzivo rwakakwana nezvekukura kwevana uye kuchengetwa kwevabereki nenzira inofadza vabereki.&nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E                              \u003Cimg src=\"https://rerai.umntwana.app/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/rerai-umntwana-logo-final_2.webp?itok=FfLGjQDq\" alt=\"Rerai Umntwana Logo\"\u003E            \u003Cp\u003EApp iyi inogona zvakare kushandiswa nevanhu vakasiyana siyana mukushanda kwavo nevabereki uye semudziyo wekuvaka hukama hwakavimbika nekudyidzana mukubatsira vana vadiki.\u003Cbr\u003EApp iyi yakagadzirirwa kuti itsigire vabereki kuita zvinhu zvinokurudzira kukura kuburikidza nemitambo nezvimwe zvinoitwa nevana uye ichavabatsira kuona kukura kwemwana nehutano hwake.\u003Cbr\u003EApp iyi ine pfimbi yakapfuma yezvinyorwa nemavhidhiyo zvakaiswa mumapoka ezvinyorwa zve:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKutamba uye kudzidza\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZvokudya zvinovaka muviri uye kuyamwisa\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKurera vana zvinehanya\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKuchengeteka uye kudzivirira\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUtano uye kugara zvakanaka\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKugara zvakanaka kwevabereki\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003EApp iri kushandisa ruzivo rwezuva rekuzvarwa kwemwana, kuve mukomana kana musikana kwake nerumwe ruzivo rwunoiswa nemubereki kuti pabude zvinoenderana nedzidziso yakafanira.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EZvimwe zvemukati muapp iyi zvakatorwa, zvikagadziridzwa uye zvikaturikirwa nemvumo kubva ku Raising Children Network Australia ( \u003Ca href=\"https://raisingchildren.net.au/\"\u003ERaising Children Network\u003C/a\u003E ), Real Play Coalition ( \u003Ca href=\"https://realplaycoalition.com/\"\u003Ehttps://www.realplaycoalition.com\u003C/a\u003E ), Afinidata ( \u003Ca href=\"https://afinidata.com/en/home/\"\u003Ehttps://afinidata.com/en/home/\u003C/a\u003E ).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIyi app inoda masai sai einternet kuti iburitse zvirimo uye kuratidza zvakasiyana.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInogona zvakare kushanda isiri pamasai sai munzvimbo dzine masai sai einternet asina kusimba. Kuti zviite saizvozvo zvinoda kuti arikushandisa app ange akambokwanisa kuisandisa pane masai sai. Mushandisi anogona kusarudza muApp Settings kuita download zvirimo zveapp zvinoenderana nezera remwana wake kana kuita download zvese zvirimo kuti akwanise kuzvishandisa zvizere pasina masai sai.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKugadzirwa kwezvimwe zvikamu zve app uye zvirimo zvakatsigirwa neAustrian Development Agency neEuropean Union.\u003C/p\u003E",
            "mandatory": 1,
            "embedded_images": [
                "/sites/zimbabwe/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2026-04/rerai-umntwana-logo-final_2.webp?itok=FfLGjQDq"
            ],
            "unique_name": "about_us"
